  "description": "“I really can’t hold back anymore.” With those words, a pair of hot, alcohol-scented lips suddenly claimed mine— before I could even gather my thoughts, my dazed lips were swallowed up. ‘Uh, this is a little…’ …No, this is completely wrong! Sasha finds herself possessed inside a romance-fantasy novel where the main plot revolves around the power struggles between nobles and royals. But the moment that story becomes her reality— the genre changes entirely. It was supposed to be a wholesome, all-ages story, one where the protagonists didn’t even share their first kiss until around chapter 100... “…Why does it feel like the genre here is way too different?\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
